  "body": "Found while working #882.\n\n**What happens:** the heavy-lane test `app pocket3d_hsm::the_users_bore_roughs_adaptive_level_by_level_and_verifies_clean` (release, `testdata/models/Milling-test.step`) fails on upstream/main f490458a, on macOS (Apple silicon), before any change. Levels Z 20.000 and Z 10.000 both fall to rings for \"crosses itself\", but the test pins only one. Its pinned move counts (5530 / 5497 / 600) were never reached.\n\nNot yet confirmed on Linux or Windows. It may be platform-dependent floating point in the planner, which would be its own finding.\n\nDone means: the test is green on main on every OS (fix the planner or re-pin with the reason in a decision file), and if the result differs across platforms, an issue names that cause.\n\nRefs #882.\n",
